1
00:00:00,179 --> 00:00:02,379
(door closes)

2
00:00:03,348 --> 00:00:04,678
(Amy:)It's not a big deal.

3
00:00:04,683 --> 00:00:07,883
(Amy:)I run tests like this on
undergrads all the time.

4
00:00:07,886 --> 00:00:09,556
(Amy:)If you fill out some
paperwork at the university,

5
00:00:09,555 --> 00:00:11,855
I can get you $5.

6
00:00:11,857 --> 00:00:13,527
I don't want $5.

7
00:00:13,525 --> 00:00:15,155
(Penny:)I want my dignity.

8
00:00:16,461 --> 00:00:18,191
(Amy:)So what are we talking,
like, ten bucks?

9
00:00:20,666 --> 00:00:22,296
(Barry:)Thank you.
Thanks.

10
00:00:24,403 --> 00:00:26,303
(Leonard:)Sorry again.
No problem.

11
00:00:26,305 --> 00:00:28,605
A-Are you sure
you're not him?

12
00:00:29,474 --> 00:00:30,644
(Raj:)Uh, you can tell us.

13
00:00:30,642 --> 00:00:33,312
(Raj:)We're scientists,
not crazy fanboys.

14
00:00:35,280 --> 00:00:36,780
(Nathan Fillion:)All right, fine.

15
00:00:36,782 --> 00:00:38,252
(Nathan Fillion:)I'm him.

16
00:00:38,250 --> 00:00:41,590
(Raj:)And you're eating
alone at a deli.

17
00:00:41,587 --> 00:00:43,787
(Raj:)I don't buy it--
you're not him.

18
00:00:43,789 --> 00:00:45,119
(chuckles)

19
00:00:45,123 --> 00:00:46,953
(Nathan Fillion:)I just wanted
to eat my lunch in peace.

20
00:00:46,959 --> 00:00:48,129
(Nathan Fillion:)But I really am him.

21
00:00:48,126 --> 00:00:50,226
(Nathan Fillion:)And thank you very much
for being a fan.

22
00:00:50,229 --> 00:00:51,759
(Nathan Fillion:)If you want, uh,
let's take a picture.

23
00:00:51,763 --> 00:00:53,093
(Howard:)That would be great.

24
00:00:53,098 --> 00:00:54,228
(Howard:)Great.
Yeah, thank you.

25
00:00:54,233 --> 00:00:55,633
(Penny:)You bet.

26
00:00:59,304 --> 00:01:01,634
(Raj:)Wait, hang on.

